    "detailed_description": "<h1>Development Roadmap</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/5104b78e95f0a29c014bddcdf9df5fad.avif?t=1726515935\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/502c057a9766b5d7b6e20e913213729e.avif?t=1726515935\" /></div><br>Become a polymorphed deity and take back Mount Olympus in this top-down puzzle game! The Titans have escaped their eternal prisons and transformed Artemiza, a young goddess, into a gorgon. Now she must petrify enemies, solve puzzles, and dodge traps in her battle to save the realms of the gods!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f005fc3dd1fe1904bfc039d297188956.avif?t=1726515935\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go full gorgon as a lovable protagonist brought to life with beautiful, and brand-new art that shines with charm!<br></li><li>Battle Royale with your friends as Little Medusa and the other Little Olympians in the all new multiplayer mode!<br></li><li>Customize your multiplayer battles with over 30 modifiers!<br></li><li>Petrify your way through 5 worlds of puzzles and danger!<br></li><li>Clash with centaurs, fallen heroes, and the Titans themselves!<br></li><li>Solve the puzzles fast enough and unlock a secret world, complete with a new ending to the story! <br></li><li>Carve a brand new myth with an exciting story inspired by Greek mythology!<br></li><li>For all the Greek gods and goddesses out there, we've added Olympian Mode, a hard as rock challenge with permadeath. You've got one chance to get beat each stage, defeat all the Titans, and Go Full Gorgon to unlock the final achievement!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join our Discord for discussion, news, and updates!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/502c057a9766b5d7b6e20e913213729e.avif?t=1726515935\" /></div><br>Become a polymorphed deity and take back Mount Olympus in this top-down puzzle game! The Titans have escaped their eternal prisons and transformed Artemiza, a young goddess, into a gorgon. Now she must petrify enemies, solve puzzles, and dodge traps in her battle to save the realms of the gods!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/310c763a1107ed7d0c83e23c717232ef.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f005fc3dd1fe1904bfc039d297188956.avif?t=1726515935\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Go full gorgon as a lovable protagonist brought to life with beautiful, and brand-new art that shines with charm!<br></li><li>Battle Royale with your friends as Little Medusa and the other Little Olympians in the all new multiplayer mode!<br></li><li>Customize your multiplayer battles with over 30 modifiers!<br></li><li>Petrify your way through 5 worlds of puzzles and danger!<br></li><li>Clash with centaurs, fallen heroes, and the Titans themselves!<br></li><li>Solve the puzzles fast enough and unlock a secret world, complete with a new ending to the story! <br></li><li>Carve a brand new myth with an exciting story inspired by Greek mythology!<br></li><li>For all the Greek gods and goddesses out there, we've added Olympian Mode, a hard as rock challenge with permadeath. You've got one chance to get beat each stage, defeat all the Titans, and Go Full Gorgon to unlock the final achievement!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/8733f824f25d8384dbaac7ead9f8991e.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join our Discord for discussion, news, and updates!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.poster.avif?t=1726515935\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.webm?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1075830/extras/f5a8c490c6b92b2eb31227bca65384bc.mp4?t=1726515935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Become a polymorphed deity and take back Mount Olympus in this top-down puzzle game! The Titans have escaped their eternal prisons and transformed Artemiza, a young goddess, into a gorgon. Now she must petrify enemies, solve puzzles, and dodge traps in her battle to save the realms of the gods!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cNonetheless, the game is fun, entertaining and it does feel like a great title that could have been in the SNES' original library of games\u201d<br />\r\n3rd Strike<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cMega Cat demonstrates how powerful and relevant these consoles are even decades after their release.\u201d<br />\r\nForbes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cIt is awesome. Highly, highly recommend buying this game. It\u2019s fun to play, and very, very cool\u201d<br />\r\nThe Gamers Lounge<br />\r\n",
